{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://house-technical-designer.local/schemas/symbol.schema.json",
  "title": "Technical Symbol Definition",
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "id",
    "semanticType",
    "discipline",
    "viewBox",
    "primitives"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "id": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "semanticType": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1
    },
    "discipline": {
      "enum": [
        "ARCHITECTURE",
        "WATER",
        "WASTEWATER",
        "VENTILATION",
        "ELECTRICAL",
        "LIGHTING",
        "HEATING",
        "PV",
        "OTHER"
      ]
    },
    "viewBox": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": [
        "x",
        "y",
        "width",
        "height"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "x": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "width": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        },
        "height": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "anchors": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "x",
          "y"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "x": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "y": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "role": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    },
    "primitives": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "enum": [
              "LINE",
              "POLYLINE",
              "POLYGON",
              "CIRCLE",
              "ARC",
              "TEXT"
            ]
          },
          "styleToken": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "Une primitive de dessin. Elle reste **ouverte**, et c'est un constat plutôt qu'une décision : le schéma et l'exemple parlent d'un `type` avec `x1, y1, x2, y2`, quand `SymbolPrimitive` du moteur parle d'un `kind` avec `start` et `end` — deux vocabulaires pour une même chose, comme pour les propriétés de matériau. La fermer demanderait de choisir lequel fait foi, et d'écrire l'union discriminée des sept genres (LINE, ARC, CIRCLE, POLYGON, POLYLINE, TEXT, INSERTION). C'est un travail à part, et le durcissement du format l'a mis au jour plutôt que de le régler en silence."
      }
    },
    "scaleRules": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": true
    },
    "references": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object"
      }
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
